@startuml
skinparam shadowing false

title MED-06 - DEPLOYMENT DIAGRAM

node "User Device" as CLIENT {
  artifact "Web Browser" as Browser
}

node "Docker Host / Server" as HOST {
  node "frontend container" as FEC {
    artifact "Next.js App" as NextApp
  }

  node "backend container" as BEC {
    artifact "NestJS API" as NestAPI
  }

  node "database container" as DBC {
    database "PostgreSQL" as PG
  }

  node "object-storage container\n(dev/test)" as OSC {
    artifact "MinIO" as MinIO
  }
}

cloud "S3-compatible Object Storage\n(production option)" as S3

Browser --> NextApp : HTTPS
NextApp --> NestAPI : REST/JSON HTTPS
NestAPI --> PG : PostgreSQL connection
NestAPI --> MinIO : S3 API (dev/test)
NestAPI ..> S3 : S3 API (production)

note right of HOST
Docker Compose có thể chạy:
- frontend
- backend
- PostgreSQL
- MinIO
cho môi trường đồ án.
end note

note bottom of NestAPI
Search MVP dùng PostgreSQL.
Không cần Elasticsearch/Kafka/Kubernetes.
end note

@enduml
